{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Your body is made of many amazing parts that work together every day.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.36,0.73],[0.79,0.91],[1,1.23],[1.28,1.35],[1.52,1.89],[1.96,2.63],[2.77,3.37],[3.75,3.98],[4.05,4.32],[4.39,4.84],[4.93,5.22],[5.29,5.99]]},{"text":"Inside your head is your brain. The brain helps you think, learn, and remember.","words":[[0,0.59],[0.64,0.82],[0.91,1.13],[1.2,1.3],[1.36,1.53],[1.61,2.21],[2.5,2.67],[2.74,3.05],[3.12,3.41],[3.46,3.55],[3.69,4.28],[4.53,4.97],[5.02,5.2],[5.28,6.32]]},{"text":"Your heart is always working. It pumps blood all around your body.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.41,0.73],[0.8,0.92],[1,1.39],[1.45,2.03],[2.24,2.39],[2.46,2.81],[2.88,3.24],[3.33,3.6],[3.67,3.99],[4.05,4.19],[4.25,5.02]]},{"text":"You can feel your heart beating when you run or jump.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.24,0.41],[0.49,0.74],[0.81,0.99],[1.09,1.42],[1.5,1.87],[1.94,2.13],[2.17,2.26],[2.4,2.73],[2.87,3.08],[3.22,4.04]]},{"text":"Your lungs help you breathe in air and breathe out air.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.36,0.7],[0.76,0.96],[1.03,1.1],[1.2,1.56],[1.63,1.73],[1.87,2.19],[2.28,2.44],[2.51,2.84],[2.91,3.17],[3.25,3.95]]},{"text":"When you breathe in, your body gets oxygen to help you stay strong.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.38],[0.45,0.82],[0.89,1.28],[1.49,1.67],[1.74,2.03],[2.09,2.33],[2.42,3],[3.08,3.17],[3.27,3.53],[3.6,3.69],[3.75,4],[4.08,4.97]]},{"text":"Your muscles help you move your arms, legs, and even your smile.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.31,0.73],[0.8,1.03],[1.1,1.17],[1.26,1.51],[1.56,1.73],[1.82,2.37],[2.54,2.93],[2.97,3.16],[3.24,3.48],[3.54,3.71],[3.79,4.69]]},{"text":"Bones inside your body help hold you up and protect important organs.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.5,0.91],[0.95,1.09],[1.16,1.49],[1.57,1.82],[1.92,2.19],[2.26,2.38],[2.48,2.66],[2.74,2.9],[3,3.52],[3.58,4.18],[4.25,5.2]]},{"text":"All your body parts work together like a team to keep you healthy.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.49],[0.56,0.84],[0.92,1.31],[1.38,1.64],[1.71,2.17],[2.25,2.46],[2.51,2.53],[2.61,2.9],[2.98,3.05],[3.13,3.37],[3.42,3.52],[3.61,4.55]]},{"text":"Your body is strong and amazing — and it works all day and night!","words":[[0,0.28],[0.36,0.72],[0.78,0.88],[0.95,1.52],[1.6,1.73],[1.8,2.45],[2.62,2.69],[2.94,3.1],[3.17,3.26],[3.35,3.79],[3.88,4.17],[4.31,4.57],[4.64,4.78],[4.89,5.62]]}]}